{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7OeiqkUnCHoliCJR1BBIjQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.612982+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7OeiqkUnCHoliCJR1BBIjQ","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/iadGcHegc7t3gzQMkRSTqzpl2NsSxpE5Hz5LTsweL0Q8f0icCxTqtgzMOQleXibpgOUFibwVlqL0pKDzwUmFgfPjYyw9aw6vLmbI9F5KRfscltk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2SJWXolrnEIAjWF3Q90fwhiaGYzg0UCmcujhuRYCIqnCY6iaJY00ibLhKXNf75nzbANGfR98sbhqic7lIls58TwAdDWvXdFTFARy4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>南京理工大学智能科学与技术学</span></span></strong><span><strong><span>院</span></strong></span><span>由原智能制造学院（2020年6月成立）重组而来，2025年9月正式揭牌成立。学院拥有智能科学与技术一级学科博士点，设有智能科学与技术、智能制造工程2个本科专业，是学校服务国家“两个强国”、长三角区域一体化发展等国家重大战略，以及区域产业转型升级的重要载体。学院依托南京理工大学机械工程、控制科学与工程、计算机科学与技术、管理科学与工程等优势学科基础，采用跨学院、跨专业、跨学科联合共建方式，逐步形成了智能算法与基础理论、智能交叉应用、智能系统与工程等特色研究方向。学院以智能科学与技术学科点为基础，重点面向“工业具身智能”和“集成电路装备智能制造”两大领域，着力推进“智能+”前沿交叉学科专业体系建设。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1kJE0JFeKCg7ERavxWvUVRLO8tBTomfVyFSYOBSMpPQ2aZzYvziaXOdAs3M8icGibJ3FKaYLRuF2Q40HcpsuzDKFGRlGjpcgjaXg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院现有教职工</span><strong><em><span><span>40</span></span></em></strong><span>余人，其中</span><strong><em><span><span>20</span></span></em></strong><span>余人具有高级职称，专任教师中拥有博士学位的比例达到</span><strong><em><span><span>100%</span></span></em></strong><span>，具有海外留学背景的超过</span><strong><em><span><span>60%</span></span></em></strong><span>，形成了一支专兼结合、国际化的高水平师资队伍。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2ibwpU7HShG6bR2f6HnW7q9RiaI7YdvqVIeqibAYJzPFoCKbicMw2XibdYJHAw7E09VlbmyZWpZuzfskMiaxq6ribpTiciaiagn1ib5AGMwE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1jY5qPgxegTfaD76s3r9OoCiaOQnOpkKbH0fuT3zmByUsM7gNgKDQgq9IhLbjYnFhRlfdwK4R5BPSTMdbQwaprMDdqdo8dmemU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1NWgEUvlIRicJH1BQAcA3eUibIHNN1CQ3OlRQNiauibMR350mLal9icCficfG63Sm8OKOORCSdT5SFLQgJpKNlbsmdwxrl5FdMFiaNQ4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0WNBNgMxQMeaNjxvlJ8ATO8WLt2yvheTmp4mQ8D1aSnThfbxMOkpxowicXk3JZE80licKfO8NibXb5TYfCLuOraSB3WDPjMfcNjg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3FzRcXemiaI8icTDicNr5NV5iaJoTVcYqUY5icGYHohjXkoUQhp8icVqoJGWwiaez3vnYePaNEmzZbLmiarP50T2HBudZ9J7DghicdnibicI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0wO97blmD8sjV0wv8x4yt1KB2QS4YHJqb6AbonX25NVsOyv0w7YFiamdwFBa9MnyNnu2XGVvic8ZpZO7ibteHsrcrvXVNAsaUPyw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院实验条件和科研训练平台建设完善，建有“高维信息智能感知与系统”教育部重点实验室等3个省部级实验平台，工信部校企协同育人基地，为人才培养打造一流工程实践与创新学习平台。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2tGS2xl1UEBbDicJNovG9ZfibO2TT2BAKzjmpv1fH5rTBeciaNUZ20EaEH8QLRwAzvUvjicO2T2WoibS9d4NXzMt01CzASZ2ia4bfVg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1mTb3uIlGdWfY5fRhnicnUUV25I4N761Vv0duk2VX9ft9kVI6SR8a5aHdwnlsdicOoTZaiaLEYvfoqaYwZO4yuaHFu2m4u5iak6wU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0bOVxNicTxgZelvWC5n9P4NoHM3QExnBLh7NFX6QXOx6WnPkjHRJia1lg6NgXu7EnqTZ60soX7aTPvHWU018wwickTqbK0C1icggo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>50人</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线下</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月5日-7月30日（不在时间范围内的申请无效）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2027年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为</span><span><strong><span>智能科学与技术</span></strong></span><span>及相近专业，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><strong><span>.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过</span><strong><span><span>邮件</span></span></strong><span>方式进行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）校园开放日报名申请表（系统导出打印签字扫描）；</span></p><p><span>（2）个人陈述（1000 字以内，介绍科研兴趣、读研规划）；</span></p><p><span>（3）本人居民身份证和学生证复印件。</span></p><p><span>（4）由教务处或所在院系开具的现有本科阶段成绩单与专业总评成绩排名证明（须学校教务部门或学院盖章）。</span></p><p><span>（5）外语水平证明（如CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等的证书或成绩单）。</span></p><p><span>（6）其它能证明本人成绩及潜力的材料，如校级及以上获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文、资格证书等复印件。</span></p><p><span>请申请人将以上材料</span><span><strong><span>按序号整理排序</span></strong></span><span>，合并成一个PDF，要求</span><strong><span><span>有目录和页码</span></span></strong><span>等，方便专家审阅。</span></p><p><span>PDF命名方式：</span><strong><span><span>校园开放日2026申请资料-本科院校名称-姓名。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>PDF文件需压缩后，在</span><strong><span><span>7月31日上午8:00前</span></span></strong><span>（不在时间范围内的发送无效）发送至邮箱</span><span><strong><span>yz128@njust.edu.cn</span></strong></span><span>，请勿重复发送。</span></p><p><span>所提交的材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，将取消申请资格。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0XdN0gWY5BsXibj75wQZsmSHYKhUX8YPmxBEP16TE2J5iadleZ57DniaqzCuJgVSRsnxib2KGfZ7nfnMFA2q1Rmd86ERoaUAOiaFWA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人：胡老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0510-82182399</span></p><p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><span>yz128@njust.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>南理工智能学院公众号</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>南理工研招公众号</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2T4uGz7tmgsPl7vjtCib0quWYy1cHIO9EdoIf1VEgNjhctJNr19dicgHQMX9S3ybM7CwkWWQwkg2OsbS6rfn5ypXvSGU47veJa0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t15Xb4aXGWbWCDm3EkndBib5VfJzE2wic7bUQQNrEotStHgshwScmf5m32wPE0AcF3icP4EribibXdetiaUCfs2zBGSyxqDebQlicJicic0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>南理工智能学院研招咨询QQ群（645507083）</span></p></section></se